    "body": "My apologies for not searching for duplicates ahead of time. I'm not very familiar with the process. How would I go about creating more interest? Should I make feature requests to other browser vendors (besides Firefox, which was already given a bug in the mentioned ticket)? Or do you mean user support? In which case, how would I demonstrate that support?\r\n\r\nThank you.",
