    "created_at": "2018-10-08T12:25:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-08T12:25:30Z",
    "body": "User support would usually be shown through popular libraries that would add this missing functionality. If there's implementer interest already from Firefox this might be a little easier. Then it would depend on figuring out how to express this in IDL (possibly filing an issue at https://github.com/heycam/webidl/ for advice), someone writing the actual text for the standard, someone writing tests, and someone filing bugs against all implementers. (These can all be the same person.)\r\n\r\nA more high-level (but also more detailed) description of this process can be found at https://whatwg.org/working-mode.",
